From 723a07f940b141de095dbca5952c000601c71c10 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Voqii <codylepine4@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 04:21:15 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] 3.5-voqii: loneliness only while racing

With loneliness.enabled, sitting in any boat anywhere hid every other player (and dropped them from the tab list). Now it only applies during a time trial or a heat; heats keep their own collision modes. The time-trial map refreshes visibility whenever a run ends, however it ends.
---
 pom.xml                                       |  2 +-
 .../loneliness/LonelinessController.java      | 29 ++++++++++++++++---
 .../system/timetrial/TimeTrialController.java | 14 ++++++++-
 3 files changed, 39 insertions(+), 6 deletions(-)

